    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A truly rare opportunity awaits you with this detached site held in Folio KY29090F (Plan 133), extending over an impressive 0.36Ha/0.88-acres. Accessed via a registered right of way off the public cul-de-sac road leading to the scenic Cashen beach car park, this premium plot commands stunning views of both the world-renowned Ballybunion Golf Links (Cashen Course) and its iconic Clubhouse. Golf enthusiasts and visionary builders will appreciate the unrivalled location, sitting within easy walking distance of the links and just 2km from the vibrant Ballybunion seaside resort. \r\n\r\nOffered for sale subject to the proposed buyer obtaining a grant of Full Planning Permission, this blank canvas comes with all mains services readily available, making it the perfect foundation for a dream coastal residence. Additional information and maps are available on request; to secure your stake in this highly sought-after landscape, please contact Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers today on 068 21739."
      },
